{'symbol': 'INVH', 'date': '2021-07-28 16:15:00', 'title': 'INVITATION HOMES REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'DALLAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INVITATION HOMES INC. (NYSE: INVH) ("INVITATION HOMES" OR THE "COMPANY"), THE NATION\'S PREMIER SINGLE-FAMILY HOME LEASING COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS Q2 2021 FINANCIAL AND OPERATING RESULTS. SECOND QUARTER 2021 HIGHLIGHTS YEAR OVER YEAR, TOTAL REVENUES INCREASED 9.3% TO $492 MILLION, PROPERTY OPERATING AND MAINTENANCE COSTS INCREASED 5.0% TO $175 MILLION, NET INCOME AVAILABLE TO COMMON STOCKHOLDERS INCREASED 40.8% TO $60 MILLION, AND NET INCOME PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE'}